sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Client as Client or oracle submitter
    participant Cron as CRE Cron
    participant WF as Pending NAV Workflow
    participant NAV as NavOracleAutomation
    participant Receiver as Receiver for target vault
    participant Vault as IssuanceVault

    Note over Client,NAV: Outside current CRE scope
    Client->>NAV: submitNav()
    alt vetoPeriod is zero
        NAV->>Vault: Apply NAV immediately and advance epoch
        Note over Cron,WF: CRE has no pending NAV to apply
    else vetoPeriod is positive
        NAV->>NAV: Store pending NAV until readyAt
    end

    Cron->>WF: Run every 5 minutes
    loop Each vault
        WF->>NAV: checkUpkeep(0x)
        alt Pending NAV is ready
            NAV-->>WF: upkeepNeeded is true
            WF->>Receiver: Signed report for performUpkeep(0x)
            Receiver->>NAV: performUpkeep(0x)
            NAV->>Vault: Apply pending NAV and advance epoch
        else No ready pending NAV
            NAV-->>WF: upkeepNeeded is false
            WF-->>Cron: Finish without transaction
        end
    end

    Note over Client,NAV: rejectPendingNav() is also outside CRE scope
